Janex Java bootstrap

The sources under src/vendor/java/org/janex/bootstrap/internal/zstd, except
MemoryAccess.java, derive from japp (https://github.com/janex-dev/japp), commit
490909e06fb91da8ad5846d6977d02167fbc80d3. They retain their Apache License 2.0
headers. japp's Zstandard implementation derives from Airlift Aircompressor.
XxHash64.java is Copyright 2023 Glavo and implements Zstandard frame checksums;
it does not change Janex's XXH3 checksum algorithms.

Janex modifications: relocated packages; replaced Unsafe access with checked
byte-array access; removed direct-buffer and post-Java-8 reachability APIs;
reset frame-local Huffman tables and match history; checked frame input bounds,
content sizes and checksum boundaries; supported skippable and empty frames;
removed the window-size restriction for the full-output-buffer decoder.

